  "prefLabel": "Liq 705.40 Tobacco Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 705.40 Tobacco Licenses. Applicants for a tobacco retailer, tobacco sampler or a tobacco vending license shall complete and submit Form LTW-17, “License Type Worksheet-Retail Tobacco / Tobacco Sampler / Tobacco Vending” (revised 8/2020) providing all required information and acknowledgments.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Liq 700) #13114, eff 9-25-20; ss by #14515, EMERGENCY, eff 2-17-26; ss by #14520, EMERGENCY, eff 2-25-26, EXPIRED: 8-24-26, reverted back to #13114",
